SubmissionOut.description:
`GET /api/v1/listings/{listing_id}/submissions`: one publish attempt (at most 3 per
approved version). `field_paths` is set only for a `patch` (the failed paths being resent);
`error` is the attempt's one ErrorReport. Storage keys, digests and raw bodies stay internal.

TenantPatch.description:
A partial update of the brand profile: at least one field. `tone: null` clears the tone;
`name`, `guidelines` and `glossary` cannot be null (send `[]` or `{}` to clear a list or map).
`glossary` maps a term to avoid to the preferred term (`{"kurta outfit": "kurta set"}`).

post.description:
Check the marketplace status now: 202 with the sync job (a live one is returned as is).
Allowed on a `published` listing, or a `failed/publish_partial` one after a partial accept;
409 otherwise, 429 for a second request within 5 minutes.
